{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up in an Abandoned Mental Hospital, Daniel studies some notes to escape from here and tries to escape by solving the password. In this first-person game, you try to uncover the mysteries and escape from here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you examine the notes and find the passwords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find Notes and Keys, find coded or locked doors and find the necessary notes from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no Save System in this Game. The duration of the game is 30+ minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3419720?t=1743276144","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743276144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419720/fb68f77910505e7f0cd8b393cef56a8d695a15ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743276144","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419720/fb68f77910505e7f0cd8b393cef56a8d695a15ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743276144","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Development Process</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We made this game as 2 people. This has been a long time coming for us. If there are some deficiencies in the game, you can contact us.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up in an Abandoned Mental Hospital, Daniel studies some notes to escape from here and tries to escape by solving the password. In this first-person game, you try to uncover the mysteries and escape from here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you examine the notes and find the passwords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find Notes and Keys, find coded or locked doors and find the necessary notes from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no Save System in this Game. The duration of the game is 30+ minutes.</p>","developers":["Genesis Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419720/header.jpg?t=1743276144","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095748,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095748/movie480.mp4?t=1738970311","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095748/movie_max.mp4?t=1738970311"},"name":"The Madness - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095748/dcb70ff6c587d306fe2bb4cf65073bc9d97f775e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738970311","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095748/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738970311","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095748/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738970311"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257086544,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086544/movie480.mp4?t=1737112925","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086544/movie_max.mp4?t=1737112925"},"name":"The Madness GamePlay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086544/fee03d97d7b630177a26555f27d09a80d0f0adf9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737112925","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/